      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory RTO Paperwork, Transit Marine Insurance &amp; Delivery Handover for Bike Transport from Bangalore</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Transporting a motorcycle from Bangalore to Mangalore requires more than just a reliable carrier; it demands meticulous documentation to ensure a smooth, hassle‑free journey. Below is a concise checklist of the essential paperwork you must prepare before handing over your bike to a logistics provider.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Self‑attested RC Photocopy</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Registration Certificate (RC) is the legal proof of ownership. A self‑attested photocopy, signed by the registered owner, confirms that the vehicle is yours and that the carrier can legally move it.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Current Pollution Under Control (PUC) Certificate</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A valid PUC is mandatory for all road‑traveling vehicles in India. The certificate should be issued within the last 12 months and must be attested by the dealer or a government authority.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Valid Insurance Certificate</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Your motorcycle’s insurance must be active and cover the entire transit period. The certificate should list the insurer, policy number, and the coverage limits.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA‑Approved Consignment Bilty</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Inland Marine Authority (IBA) requires a consignment bilty for every shipment. This document records the cargo details, consignor and consignee information, and the agreed freight terms.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>One of the most critical aspects of bike transport is safeguarding your investment against unforeseen risks. That’s why a <strong>100% declared‑value marine transit insurance</strong> is indispensable. This coverage ensures that, in the event of loss or damage, the insurer will reimburse you the full declared value of the motorcycle.</p>
<p>The policy should specify the route, mode of transport, and any special handling instructions. By opting for 100% declared value, you eliminate the risk of under‑insurance, which could otherwise leave you with a significant financial gap.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">In summary, assemble the self‑attested RC photocopy, the current PUC, the active insurance certificate, and the IBA‑approved bilty before dispatch.</p>
